\f[NSI]\s[8]Restricted Freedom (Chained to Desk)
.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]The **Weathered Salaryman** works hard to
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]provide for his family, and he's glad his labor has
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]earned promotions and kept them secure.
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Somewhere in all those hours at his desk, though,
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]there may have been dreams he once had. He can't
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]remember.
